1. Purpose of the Session
Understand AI and Machine Learning (ML) in data products
Learn how to design, build, and evaluate AI-enabled solutions
Explore practical integration methods into data pipelines
2. Core Concepts (Knowledge – KSB Alignment)
AI vs Machine Learning
AI: Simulates human decision-making
ML: Learns patterns from data without explicit programming
Types of ML:
Supervised
Unsupervised
Reinforcement
Role in Data Products
Enables:
Prediction (e.g. forecasting)
Automation
Personalisation
Used across industries (healthcare, finance, retail)
Example (Case Study)
IBM Watson Health:
Analysed large medical datasets
Improved diagnosis accuracy
Enabled personalised healthcare
